* ============================================================
* MCC_TIER2_OBSERVATION_CANARIES_V1.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Observation/canary script for DotTalk++ MCC data.
*
* Tier:
*   Tier-2 — diagnostic / observation only.
*
* Scope:
*   - Known or suspected behavior mismatches
*   - Parser/surface canaries
*   - Relation visibility canaries
*   - Filter/order interaction observations
*   - FIND vs SEEK behavior under active CDX/LMDB order
*
* Safety contract:
*   - No APPEND / REPLACE / DELETE / RECALL / PACK / ZAP
*   - No CREATE / ERASE / IMPORT / EXPORT to canonical data
*   - No REINDEX / BUILDLMDB
*   - No intentional mutation of refreshed test data
*
* Interpretation:
*   - This script is NOT a clean pass/fail regression.
*   - Output should be reviewed.
*   - Some sections intentionally expose known defects or unsettled behavior.
*
* Path contract:
*   - Use explicit DBF/X64 root for index/order observations.
*   - Use explicit DBF/X32 root for relation/non-index observations.
*
* Display contract:
*   - LIST may appear only where cursor/order defects are being observed.
*   - SMARTLIST / SL remains the preferred normal display surface.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF
COLOR DEFAULT
ECHO ===== MCC TIER-2 OBSERVATION CANARIES V1 START =====

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 0 - CLEAN START
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 0 CLEAN START =====
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SET FILTER TO

VERSION
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 1 - V64 CDX/LMDB FIND VS SEEK CANARY
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 1 V64 FIND VS SEEK CANARY =====
SETPATH DBF DBF/X64
SETPATH INDEXES INDEXES/X64

USE STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
SHOW INDEX

ECHO [OBSERVE] Ordered TOP should land on first LNAME key, usually ANDERSON.
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 10
TUPLE *

ECHO [OBSERVE] SEEK Taylor should find a Taylor key under active LNAME order.
SEEK Taylor
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [OBSERVE] FIND White currently appears suspect under CDX/LMDB order.
ECHO [EXPECTED-LATER] FIND White should land on a WHITE record if FIND honors active order.
TOP
FIND White
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [OBSERVE] Compare with SEEK White.
TOP
SEEK White
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [OBSERVE] LOCATE physical/predicate behavior under active order.
TOP
LOCATE LNAME = "WHITE"
RECNO
TUPLE *

SET ORDER TO 0
CLOSE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 2 - V64 ORDER ENTRY / TAG SWITCH CANARIES
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 2 V64 ORDER ENTRY / TAG SWITCH CANARIES =====
USE STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS

ECHO [OBSERVE] SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME should place order state cleanly.
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
RECNO
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5

ECHO [OBSERVE] Switch to FNAME and verify TOP changes to first FNAME key.
SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
AREA
RECNO
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5

ECHO [OBSERVE] Missing DOB tag should report error and preserve prior active tag.
SET ORDER TO TAG DOB
AREA
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5

ECHO [OBSERVE] SET ORDER TO 0 should return to physical order.
SET ORDER TO 0
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
CLOSE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 3 - V64 FILTER UNDER ORDER OBSERVATIONS
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 3 V64 FILTER UNDER ORDER OBSERVATIONS =====
USE STUDENTS
SET INDEX TO STUDENTS
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
TOP

ECHO [OBSERVE] Filter under active order: LNAME = ANDERSON.
SET FILTER TO LNAME = "ANDERSON"
COUNT
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 20
LIST 20
SET FILTER TO
TOP

ECHO [OBSERVE] Filter under active order: FNAME = AVA while order is LNAME.
SET FILTER TO FNAME = "AVA"
COUNT
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 20
LIST 20
SET FILTER TO
TOP

SET ORDER TO 0
CLOSE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 4 - V32 RELATION CANARIES
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 4 V32 RELATION CANARIES =====
SETPATH DBF DBF/X32
SETPATH INDEXES INDEXES/X32

SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL

ECHO [OBSERVE] Open schema set; this may include non-canonical files if DBF/X32 is not clean.
SCHEMAS OPEN DBF/X32
SCHEMAS

SELECT STUDENTS
TOP
LOCATE LNAME = "TAYLOR"
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [OBSERVE] Basic relation chain.
REL CLEAR ALL
REL ADD STUDENTS ENROLL ON SID
REL ADD ENROLL CLASSES ON CLS_ID
REL LIST
REL REFRESH
REL_LIST
REL_REFRESH

ECHO [OBSERVE] FoxPro-ish SET RELATION surface if registered.
SET RELATION OFF ALL
SET RELATION TO SID INTO ENROLL
REL LIST

ECHO [OBSERVE] Additive relation surface if supported.
SET RELATION ADDITIVE TO SID INTO STUD_MAJ
REL LIST

REL CLEAR ALL
SCHEMAS CLOSE

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 5 - DATE COMPARISON / ALGEBRA CANARIES
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 5 DATE COMPARISON / ALGEBRA CANARIES =====
ECHO [OBSERVE] Date arithmetic should behave as date math, not string/number accident.
CALC DATE()
CALC DATE() + 2
CALC DATE() - 2
CALC ((DATE() + 2) > DATE())
CALC ((DATE() - 2) < DATE())
CALC CTOD("2000-01-01")
CALC CTOD("2000-01-01") + 1
CALC (CTOD("2000-01-01") + 1 = CTOD("2000-01-02"))
CALC (CTOD("2000-01-01") - 1 = CTOD("1999-12-31"))

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 6 - SCRIPT CONTROL-FLOW OBSERVATIONS
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 6 SCRIPT CONTROL-FLOW OBSERVATIONS =====
ECHO [OBSERVE] False IF should run ELSE only.
IF .F.
    ECHO IF_BRANCH_RAN_UNEXPECTED
ELSE
    ECHO ELSE_BRANCH_RAN_OK
ENDIF

ECHO [OBSERVE] WHILE .F. body should not execute.
WHILE .F.
    ECHO WHILE_BODY_RAN_UNEXPECTED
ENDWHILE

ECHO [OBSERVE] UNTIL .T. body should not execute.
UNTIL .T.
    ECHO UNTIL_BODY_RAN_UNEXPECTED
ENDUNTIL

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* PHASE 7 - CLEAN SHUTDOWN
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ===== PHASE 7 CLEAN SHUTDOWN =====
SET FILTER TO
REL CLEAR ALL
SCHEMAS CLOSE
STATUS

ECHO ===== MCC TIER-2 OBSERVATION CANARIES V1 END =====
QUIT
